'''Paldean Clodsire''' (Japanese: '''パルデアドオー''' ''Paldean Dooh'') is a {{ct|Darkness}} Stage 1 Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Paldean Wonders}} expansion.

