==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's {{TCGP|Paldean Wonders}} illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Obsidian Flames|Paldean Clodsire|129}} (129/197) from the {{TCG|Obsidian Flames}} expansion.
*This card's {{TCGP|Promo-B}} illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Obsidian Flames|Paldean Clodsire|128}} (128/197) from the {{TCG|Obsidian Flames}} expansion, as was its '''Muddy Hammer''' attack.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Violet}}.

